      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 7.26,
      "end": 14.53,
      "text": "The basics are water, snacks, a light rain jacket, sunscreen and a charged phone. A small first aid kit is a good idea too."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 17.57,
      "end": 23.57,
      "text": "About half a litre per hour of hiking, more if it's hot. For a four hour walk, two litres is a safe amount."
